# .clang-format-ignore -- exclude every file in this repository from clang-format.
#
# This project is a faithful source-level reconstruction of the 2001 WON-era
# Half-Life launcher (hl.exe build 1792).  Its formatting is deliberate and
# significant: tabs, the original brace style, column-aligned member/offset
# comments, and a layout chosen to mirror the binary's structure (and, in
# Phase 4, the binary's function order).  Auto-formatting would destroy that
# fidelity, so clang-format must skip the entire tree -- IDE "format on save",
# pre-commit hooks, and bulk runs all honor this file.
#
# Patterns are matched against each file's path relative to this file.  The two
# below cover the whole repo regardless of clang-format's `*` glob semantics:
#   *      -> files at the repository root
#   **/*   -> files in every subdirectory
*
**/*
